# MVC Architecture

Arah ketergantungan: View → Controller → Services/Models → Infrastructure.

| Layer | Lakukan | Jangan |
|-------|---------|--------|
| `views/` | Progress, summary, error, path | Ollama, SymPy, persist file |
| `controllers/` | Orkestrasi + map error | Prompt LLM, rumus grading |
| `services/` | Use-case + adapter (DI) | Print ke stdout (kecuali logger) |
| `functions/` | Pure transform | I/O / network / mutasi input |
| `interfaces/` | ABC/Protocol sempit | Implementasi library konkret |

```python
# ❌ BAD — controller memanggil Ollama langsung
def process(pdf):
    return httpx.post("http://localhost:11434/...", ...)

# ✅ GOOD — controller memanggil abstraksi yang diinjeksi
def process(self, pdf: Path) -> GradeReport:
    pages = self.renderer.render(pdf)
    recognition = self.recognizer.recognize_pages(pages)
    return self.grader.grade(recognition)
```

Injection lewat konstruktor terhadap `interfaces/`. Composition over inheritance.
